    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banished. Pixelated. Determined.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juan had it all\u2014 a vibrant world, a best friend named Greg, and an adventure waiting to unfold. But after a fateful encounter with a grumpy dinosaur, he\u2019s been cast down into the <i>prototype</i> version of his own game. Now trapped in a 1-bit world of unfinished code and forgotten assets, Juan must fight, platform, and puzzle his way back to where he belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between two distinct art styles\u2014gritty 1-bit and polished 16-bit\u2014as you uncover the secrets of the <i>Prototype Realm</i>. Use your whip, shield, and quick reflexes to survive enemy encounters, traverse treacherous environments, and collect the keys needed to escape this digital purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Juan reclaim his adventure, or is he doomed to remain a half-finished idea?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Fast-paced 2D action platforming with tight controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2694\ufe0f Whip-cracking combat and strategic shield-shot mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8 Unique dual-art style aesthetic: 1-bit prototype vs. full-color 16-bit adventure\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udd11 Metroidvania-style exploration\u2014find hidden keys to progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play now and help Juan escape development hell!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banished. Pixelated. Determined.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juan had it all\u2014 a vibrant world, a best friend named Greg, and an adventure waiting to unfold. But after a fateful encounter with a grumpy dinosaur, he\u2019s been cast down into the <i>prototype</i> version of his own game. Now trapped in a 1-bit world of unfinished code and forgotten assets, Juan must fight, platform, and puzzle his way back to where he belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between two distinct art styles\u2014gritty 1-bit and polished 16-bit\u2014as you uncover the secrets of the <i>Prototype Realm</i>. Use your whip, shield, and quick reflexes to survive enemy encounters, traverse treacherous environments, and collect the keys needed to escape this digital purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Juan reclaim his adventure, or is he doomed to remain a half-finished idea?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Fast-paced 2D action platforming with tight controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u2694\ufe0f Whip-cracking combat and strategic shield-shot mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8 Unique dual-art style aesthetic: 1-bit prototype vs. full-color 16-bit adventure\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udd11 Metroidvania-style exploration\u2014find hidden keys to progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play now and help Juan escape development hell!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Juan's been banished to the prototype version of his game! He\u2019s gone from a colorful 16-bit hero to a tiny 1-bit homie. Help him platform his way back in this narrative action-platformer\u2014with Juan himself teaching you how to control him through this mini-metroidvania!",
